# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SOURCE DATA - NEVER COMMIT. The GitHub repo is PUBLIC.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# month_*.csv hold guest full names: personal data under the Philippine Data
# Privacy Act.
#
# calendar_link.csv holds the Airbnb iCal import URLs. The "?t=" token in each
# one grants read access to that unit's booking calendar to anyone who has it,
# with no expiry and no way to tell it has leaked.
#
# Keep these local. `npm run replay` and the dev server read them from disk.
data/*.csv
